From: Rob Currie <rob@example.invalid>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 01:45:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] archive: the diffs rescued from abandoned worktrees, as
 patches

Six uncommitted diffs that existed only inside worktrees scheduled for
removal, kept here as patches rather than as commits so that none of
them is mistaken for reviewed work:

  a4impl_w01  reflection cluster        LANDED as 938d8c81 + a8e6d18d
  g7_w01      container iterator decls  LANDED, narrowed, as 9c388382
  g3a_w01     enumeration draft         dropped: stale copy of 01b59d97
  g2_w01      an unused Buffer helper   dropped: unreachable, fails coverage
  impl8_w01   refusal wording           dropped: landed differently
  r3_c01      TClass::EState states     UNJUDGED - needs its own harness run

r3_c01 is the one piece here nobody has measured; everything else is
recorded so the reasoning survives the worktrees.
